WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.201 --> 00:00:21.988
"Oh, Rat," Mole cried.

2
00:00:21.989 --> 00:00:24.964
"I've been so scared!"

3
00:00:24.965 --> 00:00:27.796
Mole was shivering and tired.

4
00:00:27.797 --> 00:00:30.001
Rat patted him.

5
00:00:30.002 --> 00:00:34.408
"I tried to warn you, Mole," said Rat.

6
00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:39.189
"We Riverbankers never come here by ourselves."

7
00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:42.567
"I'm sorry, Rat," cried Mole.

8
00:00:42.568 --> 00:00:46.659
"It can be a dangerous place," said Rat.

9
00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:50.482
"There are tricks for hiking in the Wild Wood."

10
00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:53.246
"Tricks?" said Mole.

11
00:00:53.247 --> 00:00:56.433
"You need to know certain words.

12
00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:59.240
You need special plants to carry.

13
00:00:59.241 --> 00:01:02.491
You need to know the sounds in the wood.

14
00:01:02.492 --> 00:01:06.814
It's easy if you know these things," said Rat.

15
00:01:06.815 --> 00:01:11.964
"If you don't, you can get into big trouble."

16
00:01:11.965 --> 00:01:16.348
"I bet Toad comes here by himself," said Mole.

17
00:01:16.349 --> 00:01:21.828
"Old Toad?" Rat laughed.

18
00:01:21.829 --> 00:01:25.283
"He wouldn't come here for a bag of gold!"

19
00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:28.848
Mole was cheered by Rat's laugh.

20
00:01:28.849 --> 00:01:31.035
"Come on, then," said Rat.

21
00:01:31.036 --> 00:01:33.144
"It's time to go home.

22
00:01:33.145 --> 00:01:35.122
We can't stay here at night.

23
00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:36.621
It's too cold."

24
00:01:36.622 --> 00:01:40.402
Rat poked his head out of the hollow tree.

25
00:01:40.403 --> 00:01:44.160
"Oh no," said Rat.

26
00:01:44.161 --> 00:01:47.208
"What's up, Ratty?" asked Mole.

27
00:01:47.209 --> 00:01:50.255
"Snow is up," replied Rat.

28
00:01:50.256 --> 00:01:52.226
"I mean down.

29
00:01:52.227 --> 00:01:55.373
Snow is falling everywhere."

30
00:01:55.374 --> 00:01:58.965
Mole looked out of the hollow.

31
00:01:58.966 --> 00:02:02.543
The forest was covered in white.

32
00:02:02.544 --> 00:02:07.005
Big white snowflakes filled the air.

33
00:02:07.006 --> 00:02:11.601
"It's beautiful," said Mole.

34
00:02:11.602 --> 00:02:16.896
"Yes, you're right," said Rat, sounding worried.

35
00:02:16.897 --> 00:02:20.084
"The snow makes everything look different."

36
00:02:20.085 --> 00:02:23.078
"What's the matter?" asked Mole.

37
00:02:23.079 --> 00:02:30.376
"Now even I can't tell where we are!" said Rat.
